    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to bring 32 Burnaby Mews to the rental market in Greystones. Offering one of the best locations in Greystones, Burnaby Mews is a private gated development 2 minutes stroll from the main street with easy access to public DART services and local bus routes plus pedestrian access to The Meridian Centre and local shops, restaurants and amenities.\r\n\r\nNo. 32 Burnaby Mews is a delightful, bright and spacious 2 bed ground floor apartment, freshly painted and ready for occupation. The apartment offers 2 double bedrooms, a family bathroom, 2 x additional storage cupboards and a large open plan living/kitchen/dining room overlooking a spacious timber deck. \r\n\r\nThe apartment also benefits from one designated parking space.\r\n\r\nFor viewing information, email enquiries only please."
      },
